      "kind": "breach",
      "headline": "GL.iNet says attackers used a cloud flaw to install malware on routers and KVMs",
      "summary": "GL.iNet confirmed that an unauthorised party exploited a flaw in its cloud remote-management service to install malware on customers' routers and KVM devices. It says it fixed the cloud flaw and blocked the access path. It has not said how many customers were hit.",
